{"3627770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Little Crossroads", "steam_appid": 3627770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4744740], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627770/extras/69fb3a8537183de12a07057f7129428d.poster.avif?t=1787963150\" width=616 height=257 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627770/extras/69fb3a8537183de12a07057f7129428d.webm?t=1787963150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Little Crossroads</i>, a peaceful multiplayer sandbox where you can build a home, progress and develop your skills, and explore a vibrant world full of friendship.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627770/extras/e29e1fda7481e99a45200b1d5f11c1e0.poster.avif?t=1787963150\" width=616 height=251 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627770/extras/e29e1fda7481e99a45200b1d5f11c1e0.webm?t=1787963150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a variety of skills to develop like Fishing, Bug Catching, Mining, Woodcutting, and Foraging, you’re free to wander, explore, and grow however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627770/extras/eab3ec11619707ffe33c9e788e5e02d5.poster.avif?t=1787963150\" width=618 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627770/extras/eab3ec11619707ffe33c9e788e5e02d5.webm?t=1787963150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your path will be influenced by the fantastic rewards that await you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pets that are both cute AND helpful, like the &quot;Grolem&quot;, a dirt Golem that acts as a mobile farm. Grow wherever you go!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful upgrades like Wings, Boats, and super-powered Tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetic Items that dazzle and inspire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you spend your days fishing by the river, chasing butterflies through sun-dappled fields, or mining rare gems deep in the mountains?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of <i>Little Crossroads</i> lies a quiet freedom to find your path... <i>at your own pace.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627770/extras/7f71d985ae860c30bf747802ada1fd7b.poster.avif?t=1787963150\" width=616 height=179 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627770/extras/7f71d985ae860c30bf747802ada1fd7b.webm?t=1787963150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Player owns their own Little Crossroads, and at its center lies a magical signpost allowing travel to and from the worlds of other Players. Team up with friends—old or new—to build, fish, gather, and relax together in real-time multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share the journey with others, or enjoy it solo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627770/extras/891c6904c2071c1b4280922b5751e319.poster.avif?t=1787963150\" width=626 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627770/extras/891c6904c2071c1b4280922b5751e319.webm?t=1787963150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627770/extras/891c6904c2071c1b4280922b5751e319.mp4?t=1787963150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎨 Show Off your Creative Flair 🎨</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself with robust customization, both inside and out.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your character with a range of cute and cool outfits, hairstyles, and accessories. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and decorate your Crossroads and Homestead with crafted furniture and seasonal flair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're planting daisies or placing a tea set just so, <i>Little Crossroads</i> gives you the tools to make your world feel like home.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🗿 A Mysterious Origin? 🗿</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is this place, actually? And who created the magical signposts at the Crossroads that connects these parallel paradises?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover evidence and unravel the mystery, if that suits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or, let it be, and enjoy the opportunity with no strings attached.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌟 Wishlist and Follow Along 🌟</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <i>Little Crossroads</i> is still growing, and we’d love to have you along for the journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add us to your Wishlist to follow development, updates, and future playtests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Crossroads are waiting</i>. What path will you take?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627770/extras/69fb3a8537183de12a07057f7129428d.poster.avif?t=1787963150\" width=616 height=257 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627770/extras/69fb3a8537183de12a07057f7129428d.webm?t=1787963150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Little Crossroads</i>, a peaceful multiplayer sandbox where you can build a home, progress and develop your skills, and explore a vibrant world full of friendship.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627770/extras/e29e1fda7481e99a45200b1d5f11c1e0.poster.avif?t=1787963150\" width=616 height=251 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627770/extras/e29e1fda7481e99a45200b1d5f11c1e0.webm?t=1787963150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a variety of skills to develop like Fishing, Bug Catching, Mining, Woodcutting, and Foraging, you’re free to wander, explore, and grow however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627770/extras/eab3ec11619707ffe33c9e788e5e02d5.poster.avif?t=1787963150\" width=618 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627770/extras/eab3ec11619707ffe33c9e788e5e02d5.webm?t=1787963150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your path will be influenced by the fantastic rewards that await you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pets that are both cute AND helpful, like the &quot;Grolem&quot;, a dirt Golem that acts as a mobile farm. Grow wherever you go!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful upgrades like Wings, Boats, and super-powered Tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetic Items that dazzle and inspire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you spend your days fishing by the river, chasing butterflies through sun-dappled fields, or mining rare gems deep in the mountains?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of <i>Little Crossroads</i> lies a quiet freedom to find your path... <i>at your own pace.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627770/extras/7f71d985ae860c30bf747802ada1fd7b.poster.avif?t=1787963150\" width=616 height=179 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627770/extras/7f71d985ae860c30bf747802ada1fd7b.webm?t=1787963150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Player owns their own Little Crossroads, and at its center lies a magical signpost allowing travel to and from the worlds of other Players. Team up with friends—old or new—to build, fish, gather, and relax together in real-time multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share the journey with others, or enjoy it solo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627770/extras/891c6904c2071c1b4280922b5751e319.poster.avif?t=1787963150\" width=626 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627770/extras/891c6904c2071c1b4280922b5751e319.webm?t=1787963150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627770/extras/891c6904c2071c1b4280922b5751e319.mp4?t=1787963150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎨 Show Off your Creative Flair 🎨</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself with robust customization, both inside and out.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your character with a range of cute and cool outfits, hairstyles, and accessories. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and decorate your Crossroads and Homestead with crafted furniture and seasonal flair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're planting daisies or placing a tea set just so, <i>Little Crossroads</i> gives you the tools to make your world feel like home.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🗿 A Mysterious Origin? 🗿</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is this place, actually? And who created the magical signposts at the Crossroads that connects these parallel paradises?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover evidence and unravel the mystery, if that suits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or, let it be, and enjoy the opportunity with no strings attached.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌟 Wishlist and Follow Along 🌟</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <i>Little Crossroads</i> is still growing, and we’d love to have you along for the journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add us to your Wishlist to follow development, updates, and future playtests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Crossroads are waiting</i>. What path will you take?</strong></p>", "short_description": "Escape the rush of your other life in this multiplayer Cozy RPG. Advance in a deep progression of skills like Fishing, Mining, and Bug Catching. Unlock cute and cool cosmetics to customize your character. Experience the &quot;cozy chaos&quot; of random events. All solo or with friends. Welcome home!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627770/2560d45b762d77f09eeecece3e016c46d11f986f/header.jpg?t=1787963150", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627770/703e2ad2c75cc177c847f85413f632f5141cbc13/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787963150", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627770/703e2ad2c75cc177c847f85413f632f5141cbc13/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787963150", "website": "https://littlecrossroads.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core 2.4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11 compatible GPU (e.g., NVIDIA GeForce GTX 460 or AMD Radeon HD 6850)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated or dedicated sound card<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> None<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Performance may vary on low-end systems. Internet required for multiplayer.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>